		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
			1.132.8
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, but 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατηρ-τηρέω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			541
		</span></i><i><span class="en">
			<u>A</u>
			4
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watch
				closely, observe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				836d
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				612b28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μή τι πάθωσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					9.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>maintain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐλευθερίαν</span> Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.184
