				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρέπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1178a13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ βίου δίκαια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					637
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν καὶ τὴν ἑαυτῶν πίστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.7.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν εὔνοιαν</span>”
