					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εῖται τὸν καιρόν</span>
